Airchord
========

Airchord is an independent reimplementation of **Gesture Synth**, created by
Eric Wei.

  Original project : https://github.com/ericwei97-cloud/gesture-synth
  Live version     : https://gesture-synth-weld.vercel.app/
  Author           : https://indecisiveeric.com

The gesture vocabulary — which fingers select which scale degree, the wrist lean
that overrides the key, the right hand's control of voicing, octave, filter and
volume — is Eric Wei's design. Airchord reimplements it from observed behaviour
and from the original's published documentation; no source code was copied. The
original's source was read to extract parameter values, which are facts about how
the instrument behaves.

Gesture Synth's licence permits adaptation for personal, educational and
non-commercial purposes provided credit is given, and reserves commercial use to
its author. Airchord inherits those terms. See LICENSE.

